            "text": "{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"5f53fed9-d01d-4fd6-8631-8aa3ce47877a\",\"body\":\"TAC-678 is complete and pushed to `internationalization` (`914bbff4`). Sessions, mission chat, composer, turn chrome, previews, and related shared UI now use the typed `sessions` namespace.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-31T23:49:52.293Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T23:49:52.260Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"7bb64ca1-4ccb-4cc1-a05e-9dd0885f1af0\",\"body\":\"TAC-682 first slice is pushed (`41f2d201`) with typed `settings` resources and core Settings/Connections/Integrations coverage. TAC-682 stays In Progress for remaining user-facing Settings sections; capability-specific UI remains assigned to TAC-683.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:13:22.058Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:13:22.016Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"086b3382-0eac-40c2-b16c-ab49be138d8c\",\"body\":\"Wave 2 has started while the remaining wave-1 branches finish validation:\\n- TAC-679 — collections\\n- TAC-680 — apps & builders\\n\\nBoth branches start from the current pushed `internationalization` tip, including TAC-684 and TAC-686.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:09:26.962Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:09:26.888Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"9f7b5094-8562-4902-93b4-ec51bcd9cdc8\",\"body\":\"TAC-684 is complete and pushed to `internationalization` (`ecb15f31`). Onboarding and public/auth-adjacent shells now use a typed `onboarding` namespace with complete English and Brazilian Portuguese resources.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:08:34.415Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:08:34.379Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"85ea8623-6e7a-46ef-9bc4-09e9c8712621\",\"body\":\"TAC-686 is complete and pushed to `internationalization` (`ce2b9c9c`). The public docs site now has a maintained `pt-BR` visitor journey, localized VitePress chrome, route-aware language switching, and explicit English fallback behavior.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:00:33.013Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:00:32.874Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"72fda2b7-173d-45ac-909a-0eb1647321fd\",\"body\":\"## Implementation resumed (2026-07-31)\\n\\n`internationalization` had no unique commits beyond the foundation and was 164 commits behind `main`. It has now been fast-forwarded to current `main` (`8b280fc7`) and pushed.\\n\\nWave 1 is in progress in isolated branches/worktrees:\\n- TAC-678 — sessions & chat\\n- TAC-682 — settings, connections & integrations\\n- TAC-684 — onboarding & auth flows\\n- TAC-686 — main website\\n\\nEach ticket will receive implementation and verification updates before its commits are integrated into `internationalization`.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-31T21:45:09.171Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T21:45:08.973Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"2951ad4e-0828-4087-a101-429650ce3915\",\"body\":\"## Foundation step complete\\n\\nTAC-676 + TAC-677 are **Done** and present on **`internationalization`** (`1d7256f1`, from #759).\\n\\nNext: area tickets (TAC-678+) PR into `internationalization` until the epic is ready for `internationalization` → `main`.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-22T16:19:19.882Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-22T16:19:19.795Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"8864d31e-5d0d-4745-b341-1c5fb606797c\",\"body\":\"## Branch strategy update (2026-07-22)\\n\\nOngoing i18n work uses the long-lived Git branch **`internationalization`** (not direct merges to `main`).\\n\\n* Open / target PRs against `internationalization`.\\n* Keep stacking area tickets there until the epic is done.\\n* Final ship: PR `internationalization` → `main`.\\n\\nTAC-676/677 foundation is already on `main` via #759; `internationalization` was created from that tip for remaining child work.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-22T16:17:23.170Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-22T16:17:23.132Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"0030203a-520d-4b2e-aeb9-7d5ed5ef4e81\",\"body\":\"## Implementation schedule (2026-07-21)\\n\\nLocales: `en` (source) + `pt-BR`.\\n\\n### Sequence\\n1. **TAC-676** — base i18next framework (In Progress)\\n2. **TAC-677** — app shell & navigation (In Progress; lands with / right after framework)\\n3. Area tickets (parallel after shell; preferred order):\\n   - TAC-678 sessions & chat\\n   - TAC-682 settings, connections & integrations\\n   - TAC-684 onboarding & auth\\n   - TAC-679 collections\\n   - TAC-680 apps & builders\\n   - TAC-681 teams & organization\\n   - TAC-683 capabilities\\n   - TAC-685 presentations, ads, files & misc\\n4. **TAC-686** — main website (VitePress) — can start once locale codes/conventions from TAC-676 are fixed\\n\\n### Conventions\\n- Namespaces: `common`, `shell`, then area names matching tickets\\n- Persistence: `genesis-locale` localStorage (logout-preserved); Appearance language switcher\\n- Docs: `apps/web/src/web/i18n/README.md`\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07