            "text": "{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"b015eb7a-7668-44c0-b50f-08896950ad1c\",\"body\":\"First implementation slice is integrated and pushed to `internationalization` as `41f2d201`.\\n\\nThis covers core profile/security/models, connections, MCP, integration setup/disconnect, and core sync/GitHub access UI. Integrated verification passed: web typecheck plus 7 locale/onboarding tests.\\n\\nThe issue remains **In Progress** while the remaining user-facing Settings sections and shared sync presentation copy are completed. Capability-specific UI is reserved for TAC-683; developer-only Sandbox/Developer controls and provider/runtime protocol values remain out of scope.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:13:21.267Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:13:21.231Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"f5debb1c-7f0f-414e-8089-430709506ce3\",\"body\":\"Implementation started on `tac-682-i18n-settings-connections-integrations`, based on the refreshed `internationalization` branch. Scope is Settings, Connections, integration setup/sync/access UI, and the `en` + `pt-BR` `settings` namespace. Progress and verification will be posted here as it lands.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-31T21:45:03.352Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T21:45:03.313Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"e4d16389-1697-448b-9bda-3ed66750fb7f\",\"body\":\"Target branch for this work: **`internationalization`** (not `main`). Open PRs against `internationalization`. See TAC-675 branch strategy.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-22T16:17:32.289Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-22T16:17:32.245Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"name\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\"},\"on